{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]Good [F]Chris[Bb]tians, [F]now [Bb]re[F]jo[Bb]ice[C],
[F]With [Bb]heart, [F]and soul, [Bb]and [F]vo[Bb]ice[C];
[F]Give [Bb]ye [C]heed [C7]to [F]what [C7]we [Dm]say:
[C]Je[Gm]sus [Am]Christ [C7]is [Dm]born [C]to[F]day;
[F]Ox [Bb]and [F]ass [C7]be[F]fore [C7]Him [Dm]bow,
[F]And [Gm7]He  is [Am]in [C]the [Dm]man[C]ger [Am]now.
[Cm]Christ is [Csus]born [A]to[Dm]day[C]!
[F]Christ is [Gm7]born [C]to[F]day!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb][F]Good [Bb][F]Christians, [Bb][F]now [Bb][C]rejoice,
[F][Bb]With [F]heart, [Bb]and [F]soul, [Bb]and [C]voice;
[F][Bb]Now [C]ye [C7]hear [F]of [C7]endless [Dm]bliss:
[C][Gm]Jesus [Am]Christ [C7]was [Dm]born [C]for [F]this!
[F][Bb]He [F]hath [C7]ope'd [F]the [C7]heav'nly [Dm]door,
[F][Gm7]And [Am]we [C][Dm]are [C]blessed [Am]evermore.
[Cm]Christ [Csus]was [A]born [Dm]for [C]this!
[F]Christ [Gm7]was [C]born [F]for this!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Bb][F]Good [Bb][F]Christians, [Bb][F]now [Bb][C]rejoice,
[F][Bb]With [F]heart, [Bb]and [F]soul, [Bb]and [C]voice;
[F]Now [Bb]ye [C]need [C7]not [F]fear [C7]the [Dm]grave:
[C][Gm]Jesus [Am]Christ [C7]was [Dm]born [C]to [F]save!
[F]Calls [Bb]you [F]one [C7]and [F]calls [C7]you [Dm]all
[F][Gm7]To [Am]gain [C][Dm]His [C]everlasting [Am]hall.
[Cm]Christ [Csus]was [A]born [Dm]to [C]save!
[F]Christ [Gm7]was [C]born [F]to save!
{end_of_verse}
